#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:4
msgid "BGP Neighbors"
msgstr "BGP Neighbors"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:6
msgid "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:11
msgid ""
"The BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) tab on a network router provides "
"management of BGP neighbor (peer) configurations. BGP is the primary "
"exterior gateway protocol used for routing between autonomous systems on "
"the Internet and within large enterprise networks. |morpheus| supports "
"configuring BGP neighbors on router types that expose this capability, "
"such as NSX Tier-0 Gateways."
msgstr ""
"El BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) pestaña en un network router proporciona"
" gestión de BGP neighbor (peer) configurations. BGP es el primario "
"exterior gateway protocolo utilizado para routing entre autonomous "
"sistemas en el Internet y dentro de grande enterprise networks. "
"|morpheus| soporta configuring BGP neighbors en router tipos ese expose "
"este capability, como NSX Tier-0 Gateways."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:52
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
msgid ""
"The BGP tab is available on router types that support BGP (``hasBgp`` "
"flag). Currently, NSX Tier-0 Gateways are the primary router type with "
"BGP neighbor support in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"El BGP pestaña está disponible en router tipos ese support BGP "
"(``hasBgp`` flag). Actualmente, NSX Tier-0 Gateways son el primario "
"router tipo con BGP neighbor support en |morpheus|."

